00:08:49.630 --> 00:08:54.250
used to set up xrt_tpu
config environment variable.

00:08:54.250 --> 00:08:56.290
Before you start
the training, this

00:08:56.290 --> 00:08:59.860
is required for the
user VM or your VM

00:08:59.860 --> 00:09:03.300
to be able to communicate
to the TPU instance.

00:09:06.820 --> 00:09:12.010
So we're about to demo
the PyTorch ResNet-18

00:09:12.010 --> 00:09:15.060
model on CIFAR10 data set.

00:09:15.060 --> 00:09:17.550
So as described
earlier, we start

00:09:17.550 --> 00:09:22.180
by setting the xrt_tpu
config environment variable.

00:09:22.180 --> 00:09:24.630
This is the IP address
that we noted earlier.

00:09:24.630 --> 00:09:28.240
So we execute this cell.

00:09:28.240 --> 00:09:30.010
Then define some
